Reuse exact horizontal movie filter sums across adjacent output rows.

Distribute the existing integer bilinear expression into two separable stages,
without rounding horizontal sums. RepeatNone black borders, 7-bit weights,
RGB565 quantization and channel expansion remain unchanged.
This reduces per-frame work without altering source or presentation clocks.

